        "Rows: 9 as printed. No total printed.",
        "In the last two columns the entries for rows 3-4 are set one line high: a line '...do...' / 'Do.' sits below the Rice entry, and the Sugar cane line carries '...do...' / 'Manufacture of matting and rugs...'. Assigned 'do'/'Do.' to Sugar cane and 'do'/'Manufacture...' to Matting straw (two 'do' entries for two rows); layout-based reading.",
